New mage skill: infuse.

1) Infuse writes what an essence holds onto a piece of gear.
   - The essence's quality is what it writes.
   - The whole essence is spent however little of it lands, so grow one to
     exactly the size you need.

2) A piece holds three stats at most.
   - The first may reach five, the second four, the third three.
   - A fourth will not go on at all.
   - The essence costs the same wherever you put it, so concentrating on
     one stat beats spreading across three.

3) Writing over a stat already there only ever raises it.
   - An essence that would match it or fall short is refused rather than
     wasted.

4) Hit points, mana and movement are written in blocks of five and do not
   count against the three.

See HELP INFUSE and HELP ESSENCE.
